OL,4,CAxed bus service partly replaced by    
OL,5,Crival company                          
OL,6,GA rival bus company is partly          
OL,7,Greplacing one of the routes between    
OL,8,GKent and London that is being cut by   
OL,9,GNational Express.                      
OL,11,FGoBus, based in Swanley, has announced 
OL,12,Fits new Kentish Express 007 service    
OL,13,Fwill serve Canterbury, Faversham,      
OL,14,FChatham, Gillingham, Bluewater, Bexley 
OL,15,Fand North Greenwich's Underground      
OL,16,Fstation in London.                     
OL,18,FNational Express had said its Dover    
OL,19,F007 and Ramsgate 022 routes, run by    
OL,20,Fits partner The Coach Travel Group,    
OL,21,Fwere no longer commercially            
OL,22,Fsustainable.                      G2/4 
