OL,4,CExtra police patrols deployed for      
OL,5,Csecond weekend                         
OL,6,GExtra police patrols will be deployed  
OL,7,Gin a Surrey town for the second        
OL,8,Gconsecutive weekend after repeated     
OL,9,Greports of anti-social behaviour.      
OL,11,FA dispersal order will take effect     
OL,12,Facross Horley town centre at 17:00 GMT 
OL,13,Fon Friday and last until 17:00 on      
OL,14,FSunday, Surrey Police says.            
OL,16,FThe order grants officers powers to    
OL,17,Fdirect people to leave the area if     
OL,18,Fthey have, or are likely to, be a      
OL,19,Fnuisance, commit a crime or cause      
OL,20,Fdisorder.                              
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
