OL,4,CTwo children who were struck by car    
OL,5,Cleave hospital                         
OL,6,GTwo children who were injured when     
OL,7,Gthey were struck by a car in East      
OL,8,GSussex have been released from         
OL,9,Ghospital, police say.                  
OL,11,FThe children, aged six and three, were 
OL,12,Ftaken along with a 42-year-old man -   
OL,13,Fwho was seriously hurt and remained in 
OL,14,Fhospital - following the crash at      
OL,15,Fabout 08:30 GMT on Wednesday, on the   
OL,16,FB2204 at The Stream, Catsfield.        
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
